usage: robot_control.py [-h] --port PORT
                        {status,lab12,pwm,move,servo,pose,recipe} ...

MSP432 serial client. No motion on connection; physical S1 arms each session.

positional arguments:
  {status,lab12,pwm,move,servo,pose,recipe}
    lab12               20% forward/backward/left/right, 200 ms each; wheels
                        lifted

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --port PORT           XDS110 application/backchannel serial port
